abstract: >-
  DUP Protocol industrial pin (DUP Labs) — hybrid Python + Rust L1 with prod-profile
  Docker mesh, tip-v2 satoshi soak evidence, ADR 0020 libp2p industrial mesh soak,
  fail-closed industrial gates, and an audit engagement binder. Formerly Absolute
  Blockchain Ultimate Hybrid. External firm audit pending. Not a launched public
  mainnet. Copyright Uladzimir Dabranski (D.U.P.) / DUP Labs.
